**NOT VERIFIED:** Chromium could not provide a reliable 3D frame. The Student Map loaded and the CEIT entry interaction fired, but WebGL reported context loss; after a fresh incognito tab and reload, the preview still produced no frames. I can’t confirm the rendered improvement or the requested viewport/theme/building matrix from this session.

