## Result

**PASS — responsive indoor framing and route-camera ownership improved; some interaction cases remain unverified.** The saved implementation fits the camera to authored room and circulation bounds, adjusts the framing direction for portrait screens, and keeps the Follow camera attached through route context changes. No route geometry or pathfinding rules were changed in this camera work.

## Browser verification

**PASS — indoor framing.** Chromium captures cover CEIT Ground Floor at 320×568, 360×640, 390×844, 430×932, 768×1024 and 1440×900. The floor remains readable with doors, stairs and exits visible. CABA, CANTEEN, COED Floor 6 and Student Center were also inspected. Mobile views use more of the available width; elongated layouts retain margins to avoid cropping.

**PASS — Follow rotation and pan-to-pause.** At a 390×844 viewport, orbiting left the navigation session in Follow. A deliberate pan paused playback while preserving the step, floor and selected mode; Resume reacquired the route context. A live SOS Route A/B switch also showed its restart confirmation. Confirming Route B returned to its preview with Follow selected; starting it began at CEIT Floor 6, Step 1, with the correct Right Stair instruction.

**PASS — route and transition checks.** Standard and Accessible journeys from Campus Gate to COED 306 completed with automatic arrival and cleanup. SOS journeys completed from COED 306 and CEIT Lecture Hall, including both CEIT Route A and Route B. A 2D/3D switch preserved the active route step at a Ground Floor exit handoff.

**NOT VERIFIED — zoom while the marker is moving.** Browser attempts did not establish that zoom remains effective throughout a walking segment. Touch-emulated orbit and pinch were not independently verified. The route-switch check restarted at the selected origin, but that additional Route B run was ended before arrival; a separate Route B journey had already completed.

Evidence: [CEIT mobile light capture](verification-artifacts/camera-stability-20261021/final-ceit-ground-390-light-verified.png), [CEIT desktop capture](verification-artifacts/camera-stability-20261021/final-ceit-ground-1440x900.png), [CABA mobile](verification-artifacts/camera-stability-20261021/final-caba-ground-390.png), [CANTEEN mobile](verification-artifacts/camera-stability-20261021/final-canteen-ground-390.png), [COED Floor 6 mobile](verification-artifacts/camera-stability-20261021/final-coed-floor6-390.png), [Student Center desktop](verification-artifacts/camera-stability-20261021/final-student-center-ground-1440.png), and the [Standard route recording](verification-artifacts/camera-stability-20261021/canteen-to-coed306-standard-mobile.webm).

