|---|---|
| [PublicLayout.tsx](src/components/layout/PublicLayout.tsx) | **PASS.** Preserved the map shell, mobile navbar behavior, `data-public-navbar`, and bottom navigation. Restored horizontal overflow clipping for Student Events and added a regression test in [PublicLayout.test.tsx](src/components/layout/__tests__/PublicLayout.test.tsx). |
