| [StudentCampus3DRenderer.tsx](src/components/map/StudentCampus3DRenderer.tsx) | **PASS.** Fixed the malformed outdoor bounds call and restored Event Preview camera ownership. `WorldCamera` is suppressed while Event Preview owns the camera; there is one `OrbitControls` instance. |
